{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "在书架、统计等主页面点右上角的齿轮，即可进入设置。阅读、外观、书架与同步都在这里调整。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the gear at the top right of a home page, such as Library or Statistics, to open Settings. Adjust reading, appearance, bookshelves, and sync there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在書架、統計等主頁面點右上角的齒輪，即可進入設定。閱讀、外觀、書架與同步都在這裡調整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 功能": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI Features"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后隐藏所有 AI 功能，已有连接、会话和数据共享许可保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning this off hides all AI features. Existing connections, conversations, and data-sharing permissions are kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉後隱藏所有 AI 功能，已有連線、會話和資料共享許可保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 功能已关闭。请在设置中开启后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI features are off. Turn them on in Settings to try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 功能已關閉。請在設定中開啟後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "长按文字可以标注、写批注或拷贝": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch and hold text to highlight, annotate, or copy"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "長按文字可以標註、寫批註或複製"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "长按正文选中文字，可以标注、写批注、拷贝或全文搜索。跨页选取时，在起点选择“从这里跨页选取”，翻到终点再长按选字，然后选择拷贝或“批注到这里”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch and hold to select text, then highlight, annotate, copy, or search the book. To select across pages, choose “Start Cross-Page Selection” at the beginning, turn to the end, select text again, then copy or choose “Annotate to Here”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "長按正文選中文字，可以標註、寫批註、複製或全文搜尋。跨頁選取時，在起點選擇“從這裡跨頁選取”，翻到終點再長按選字，然後選擇複製或“批註到這裡”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正文准备已暂停": {
      "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Text preparation is paused"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正文準備已暫停"}}}
    },
    "编辑详情需要先完成正文准备。": {
      "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Finish preparing the book before editing its details."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "編輯詳情需要先完成正文準備。"}}}
    },
    "正在重新读取": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading again"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在重新讀取"}}}},
    "文字编码，%@，可更换": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Text encoding, %@, can be changed"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "文字編碼，%@，可更換"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "本书": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This Book"
        }
