    }
  },
    "更换文字编码？": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Change Text Encoding?"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "更換文字編碼？"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "重新读取": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Read Again"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "重新讀取"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "正文会按新编码重新读取。当前编码下的阅读位置、书签和批注不会带到不同的新正文，原数据会保留。原文件未变时，换回原编码可找回。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The text will be read again using the new encoding. Your current position, bookmarks, and annotations will not transfer to different text. The original data is kept. If the file is unchanged, switching back restores it."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "正文會按新編碼重新讀取。當前編碼下的閱讀位置、書籤和批註不會帶到不同的新正文，原資料會保留。原檔案未變時，換回原編碼可找回。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "自动 · %@": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Auto · %@"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "自動 · %@"
        }
      }
    }
  },
