    "部分阅读数据当前版本无法理解，已保留并设为只读，请更新 App。": {
        "localizations": {
          "en": {
            "stringUnit": {
              "state": "translated",
              "value": "Some reading data is not supported by this version. It has been kept read-only. Update the app."
            }
          },
          "zh-Hant": {
            "stringUnit": {
              "state": "translated",
              "value": "部分閱讀資料當前版本無法理解，已保留並設為只讀，請更新 App。"
            }
          }
        }
      },
    "统计数据来自更新版本，请更新 App。": {
        "localizations": {
          "en": {
            "stringUnit": {
              "state": "translated",
              "value": "Statistics data comes from a newer version. Update the app."
            }
          },
          "zh-Hant": {
            "stringUnit": {
              "state": "translated",
              "value": "統計資料來自更新版本，請更新 App。"
            }
          }
        }
      },
    "统计不完整：部分记录当前版本无法理解，请更新 App。": {
        "localizations": {
          "en": {
            "stringUnit": {
              "state": "translated",
              "value": "Statistics are incomplete: some records are not supported by this version. Update the app."
            }
          },
          "zh-Hant": {
            "stringUnit": {
              "state": "translated",
              "value": "統計不完整：部分記錄當前版本無法理解，請更新 App。"
            }
          }
        }
      },
