    "ChatGPT 客户端配置无效，请检查连接配置。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The ChatGPT client configuration is invalid. Check the connection settings."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "ChatGPT 客户端配置无效，请检查连接配置。"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "ChatGPT 客戶端配置無效，請檢查連線配置。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "ChatGPT 登录已失效，请重新授权。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your ChatGPT sign-in has expired. Authorize again."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "ChatGPT 登录已失效，请重新授权。"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "ChatGPT 登入已失效，請重新授權。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "此 ChatGPT 账户或工作区不允许套餐共享，请检查账户权限。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This ChatGPT account or workspace is not eligible for plan sharing. Check account permissions."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此 ChatGPT 账户或工作区不允许套餐共享，请检查账户权限。"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此 ChatGPT 賬戶或工作區不允許套餐共享，請檢查賬戶許可權。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "暂时无法确认 ChatGPT 套餐用量，请稍后再试。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "ChatGPT plan usage cannot be checked right now. Try again later."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "暂时无法确认 ChatGPT 套餐用量，请稍后再试。"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "暫時無法確認 ChatGPT 套餐用量，請稍後再試。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "ChatGPT 套餐不支持此请求能力，请调整输入、工具或模型后再试。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your ChatGPT plan does not support this capability. Adjust the input, tools, or model before trying again."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "ChatGPT 套餐不支持此请求能力，请调整输入、工具或模型后再试。"
        }
      },
      "zh-Hant": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "ChatGPT 套餐不支援此請求能力，請調整輸入、工具或模型後再試。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "ChatGPT 套餐不支持此请求接口，请检查连接配置。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
