    "MPL 组件源码": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MPL Component Source Code"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MPL 组件源码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MPL 元件原始碼"}}}},
    "以下组件使用 MPL-2.0。打开对应版本链接后，选择 Download 即可取得源码。月读使用这些组件的未修改上游版本；其他组件的许可和版权声明在下方全文列出。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "These components use MPL 2.0. Open an exact-version link below and choose Download to obtain its source code. Moonread uses their unmodified upstream releases. Full licenses and copyright notices for other components follow below."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "以下组件使用 MPL-2.0。打开对应版本链接后，选择 Download 即可取得源码。月读使用这些组件的未修改上游版本；其他组件的许可和版权声明在下方全文列出。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "以下元件使用 MPL-2.0。開啟對應版本連結後，選擇 Download 即可取得原始碼。月讀使用這些元件的未修改上游版本；其他元件的許可和版權宣告在下方全文列出。"}}}},
    "许可与版权全文": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Full Licenses and Copyright Notices"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "许可与版权全文"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "許可與版權全文"}}}},
    "无法读取许可，请重新打开此页面。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Unable to load the licenses. Please reopen this page."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法读取许可，请重新打开此页面。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "無法讀取許可，請重新開啟此頁面。"}}}},
    "正在读取许可…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Loading licenses…"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在读取许可…"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在讀取許可…"}}}},
