    "使用自己的账户登录，在月读中讨论小说。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sign in with your account to discuss books in Moonread."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用自己的賬戶登入，在月讀中討論小說。"}}}},
