    "登录已失效，请重新授权。已有对话会保留。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your sign-in has expired. Authorize again to reconnect. Your conversations are kept."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "登入已失效，請重新授權。已有對話會保留。"}}}},
    "正在获取登录码…": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Getting a sign-in code…"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在獲取登入碼…"}}}},
