    "输入下方登录码，再回到月读。授权完成后会自动载入模型，无需重复登录。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter the code below, then return to Moonread. Models will load automatically after authorization; no need to sign in again."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "輸入下方登入碼，再回到月讀。授權完成後會自動載入模型，無需重複登入。"}}}},
