    "重新获取一个登录码，再完成授权即可。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Get a new code and complete authorization."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "重新獲取一個登入碼，再完成授權即可。"}}}},
