    "另一连接正在授权，请先完成或取消该次登录。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Another connection is being authorized. Complete or cancel that sign-in first."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "另一連線正在授權，請先完成或取消該次登入。"}}}},
