    "登录在 OpenAI 页面完成。月读不会获取你的密码；只有发起提问时才会发送问题与相关阅读上下文。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sign-in takes place on OpenAI. Moonread does not receive your password. Questions and related reading context are sent only when you ask."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "登入在 OpenAI 頁面完成。月讀不會獲取你的密碼；只有發起提問時才會傳送問題與相關閱讀上下文。"}}}},
