    "开始阅读后，这里会显示书籍、阅读时段和时长。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Start reading to see your books, sessions and reading time here."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "開始閱讀後，這裡會顯示書籍、閱讀時段和時長。"}}}},
    "开启阅读统计后记录新的阅读活动。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Turn on reading statistics to record new activity."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "開啟閱讀統計後記錄新的閱讀活動。"}}}},
    "正在读取统计": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Loading Statistics"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在讀取統計"}}}},
    "暂时无法读取统计": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unable to Load Statistics"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "暫時無法讀取統計"}}}},
