    "iCloud 中已有“%@”，替换后将使用本机文件。取消会保留两处原件。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“%@” already exists in iCloud. Replacing uses the local file. Cancel keeps both originals."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "iCloud 中已有“%@”，替換後將使用本機檔案。取消會保留兩處原件。"}}}},
