    "可在‘文件’App 的‘最近删除’中恢复。书签和笔记会保留。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You can restore these items from Recently Deleted in the Files app. Bookmarks and notes will be kept."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "可在‘檔案’App 的‘最近刪除’中恢復。書籤和筆記會保留。"}}}},
    "所在位置不支持最近删除。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This location does not support Recently Deleted."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "所在位置不支援最近刪除。"}}}},
    "所在位置不支持最近删除": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recently Deleted Is Not Supported"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "所在位置不支援最近刪除"}}}},
    "本批中有项目所在位置不支持最近删除，删除后无法恢复。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Some items in this batch are in locations that do not support Recently Deleted. Permanently deleted items cannot be restored."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "本批中有項目所在位置不支援最近刪除，刪除後無法恢復。"}}}},
