    "使用此配色的应用槽位将恢复杏桃，阅读槽位将恢复跟随应用。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App slots using this palette will return to Apricot. Reader slots will return to Follow app."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用此配色的應用程式槽位將恢復杏桃，閱讀槽位將恢復跟隨應用程式。"}}}},
    "夜色温柔，翻过一页，还有新的故事。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The night is gentle. Turn the page; another story awaits."}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "夜色溫柔，翻過一頁，還有新的故事。"}}}},
