    "问题与相关阅读上下文发送给所选服务，使用该连接的账户权限与额度。月读不提供额度，也不自动切换计费连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your question and relevant reading context are sent to the selected service, using that connection’s account permissions and allowance. Moonread provides no allowance and does not switch billing connections automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "問題與相關閱讀上下文傳送給所選服務，使用該連線的賬戶許可權與額度。月讀不提供額度，也不自動切換計費連線。"
